License: MIT, see LICENSE (copied from the tarball)

Files, copied unmodified from the tarball's package/ directory:
  build/three.module.min.js                 -> three.module.min.js
  build/three.core.min.js                   -> three.core.min.js   (three.module.min.js imports it)
  examples/jsm/controls/OrbitControls.js    -> OrbitControls.js    (imports 'three'; index.html's importmap
                                                                     maps it to ./vendor/three.module.min.js)
  LICENSE                                   -> LICENSE

To update: download a release at least two weeks old, copy the same files, and update this file.
Releases from 0.186.0 on no longer ship the .min.js builds.


